window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-202-2e1fe7949d5c4a51.json"]={sha256:"2e1fe7949d5c4a51928a42f6b80b2d69bf518abdc2e219e932646a30972c437d",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-842125f0db89ff2d","url":"https://docs.oasis-open.org/mqtt/mqtt/v5.0/os/mqtt-v5.0-os.html","title":"MQTT Version 5.0 OASIS Standard","titleEn":"MQTT Version 5.0 OASIS Standard","publisher":"OASIS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-202","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-202","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-203","referenceUrls":["https://sparkplug.eclipse.org/specification/","https://github.com/eclipse-sparkplug/sparkplug/blob/master/specification/src/main/asciidoc/chapters/Sparkplug_5_Operational_Behavior.adoc"],"title":"Eclipse Sparkplug：序列號回繞與遺失辨識","titleEn":"Eclipse Sparkplug: sequence wrap and gap detection","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學需求300 messages/s；窗口20的理想上界不足，50只通過窗口必要條件，仍須驗流量與接收能力。 mqtt5_inflight.csv、ACK時間線與吞吐上界 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 200 與變更 500 messages/s、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching demand300 messages/s:window20 is insufficient even ideally;50 passes only the window prerequisite and still needs bandwidth/receiver validation. mqtt5_inflight.csv, ACK timeline and rate ceiling Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 200 and changed 500 messages/s, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學連續性驗收要求遺失0；兩情境都失敗但需正確計2與3，並觸發資料完整性調查而非寫入錯誤狀態。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching continuity requires zero missing messages; both fail but must count two and three correctly, triggering an integrity review rather than a false state update.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成QoS 1窗口20筆、PUBLISH到PUBACK配額釋放時間0.1 s；窗口改50筆，訊息同樣大小且PUBACK可持續。 名義式 20/0.1 = 200 messages/s；變更式 50/0.1 = 500 messages/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 建立連續發送/ACK事件表，任一時刻未確認數不得超W；用1秒完成ACK數核對理想上界。","合成上一筆seq=254、下一筆觀測1，跨回繞漏掉255與0；擾動下一筆2，且同一bdSeq會話已確認。 名義式 (256-254+1)-1 = 2 missing messages；變更式 (256-254+2)-1 = 3 missing messages。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 明列預期序列255、0、1與255、0、1、2，除去最後已收到項；若跨超過一圈則單一seq不足辨識，需額外時序證據。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["SyntheticQoS1 window20 messages andPUBLISH-to-PUBACK quota-release latency0.1 s; change to50 with equal sizes and sustainedPUBACKs. Nominal 20/0.1 = 200 messages/s; changed 50/0.1 = 500 messages/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Build send/ACK events with outstanding count never exceedingW; check ideal one-second acknowledged completions against the bound.","Synthetic previousseq254 and observed next1, missing255 and0 across wrap; change next to2, with the samebdSeq session established. Nominal (256-254+1)-1 = 2 missing messages; changed (256-254+2)-1 = 3 missing messages. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Enumerate255,0,1 and255,0,1,2, excluding the final observed item; more than one full wrap cannot be disambiguated from one sequence field.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-002","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8200"],"title":"IPv6：來源分片與延伸表頭預算","titleEn":"IPv6: source fragmentation and extension-header budget","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學需求300 messages/s；窗口20的理想上界不足，50只通過窗口必要條件，仍須驗流量與接收能力。 mqtt5_inflight.csv、ACK時間線與吞吐上界 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 200 與變更 500 messages/s、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching demand300 messages/s:window20 is insufficient even ideally;50 passes only the window prerequisite and still needs bandwidth/receiver validation. mqtt5_inflight.csv, ACK timeline and rate ceiling Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 200 and changed 500 messages/s, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"列出表頭順序與每個長度，為非末片計算八位元組對齊資料預算。","differenceEn":"List header order and lengths and compute aligned payload budgets for nonfinal fragments.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成QoS 1窗口20筆、PUBLISH到PUBACK配額釋放時間0.1 s；窗口改50筆，訊息同樣大小且PUBACK可持續。 名義式 20/0.1 = 200 messages/s；變更式 50/0.1 = 500 messages/s。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 建立連續發送/ACK事件表，任一時刻未確認數不得超W；用1秒完成ACK數核對理想上界。","IPv6 路由器不替來源分片；Fragment 表頭與其他延伸表頭都消耗路徑 MTU。\n教學基準：floor((1280-40-8-24)/8)*8 = 1208 B；對照：floor((1280-40-8-48)/8)*8 = 1184 B。所有數值、事件、期限與門檻是本課明示的合成教學情境，並非官方設備規格、營運網路量測或部署建議。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["SyntheticQoS1 window20 messages andPUBLISH-to-PUBACK quota-release latency0.1 s; change to50 with equal sizes and sustainedPUBACKs. Nominal 20/0.1 = 200 messages/s; changed 50/0.1 = 500 messages/s. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Build send/ACK events with outstanding count never exceedingW; check ideal one-second acknowledged completions against the bound.","IPv6 routers do not fragment for a source; Fragment and other extension headers consume the path MTU.\nTeaching baseline: floor((1280-40-8-24)/8)*8 = 1208 B; comparison: floor((1280-40-8-48)/8)*8 = 1184 B. All numeric inputs, events, timers and limits are explicit synthetic teaching conditions, not official equipment specifications, operational-network measurements or deployment recommendations.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-7477e0be7a032a69","url":"https://sparkplug.eclipse.org/specification/","title":"Eclipse Sparkplug specification","titleEn":"Eclipse Sparkplug specification","publisher":"Eclipse Foundation","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-f67ce288e24ffb35","url":"https://github.com/eclipse-sparkplug/sparkplug/blob/master/specification/src/main/asciidoc/chapters/Sparkplug_5_Operational_Behavior.adoc","title":"Sparkplug operational behavior specification source","titleEn":"Sparkplug operational behavior specification source","publisher":"Eclipse Sparkplug","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-985315af40c6181b","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8200","title":"RFC 8200: Internet Protocol, Version 6 (IPv6) Specification","titleEn":"RFC 8200: Internet Protocol, Version 6 (IPv6) Specification","publisher":"RFC Editor / IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
